        <dc:description>&lt;p&gt;A series of eight talks on anatta, or not-self, given at a ten-day retreat in Eguilles, near Aix-en-Provence, France. Also there are relevant selections from the Pali Canon at end of the book.&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
